  m_text: '- Hold ARROWS to move/switch between options

    - Hold Z to shoot

    -
    Press A to toggle auto shooting

    - Press X to bomb/back/cancel

    - Press
    ESC to pause/back/cancel

    - Move high up the screen to auto collect all items

    -
    Hold SHIFT to focus, slow down and show hitbox'
